=== a range is cut at the chunks holding it
  whole file                   chunk=8 count=3 [0,24) -> #0[0,8)@0 #1[0,8)@8 #2[0,8)@16 (covers)
  inside one chunk             chunk=8 count=3 [9,11) -> #1[1,3)@0 (covers)
  across a boundary            chunk=8 count=3 [6,10) -> #0[6,8)@0 #1[0,2)@2 (covers)
  aligned to the boundary      chunk=8 count=3 [8,16) -> #1[0,8)@0 (covers)
  every chunk but the first    chunk=8 count=3 [5,24) -> #0[5,8)@0 #1[0,8)@3 #2[0,8)@11 (covers)

=== the chunk count is the end of what can be served
  past the last chunk          chunk=8 count=2 [12,28) -> #1[4,8)@0 (covers)
  starting past the last chunk chunk=8 count=2 [16,24) -> (none) (covers)
  a file with no chunks        chunk=8 count=0 [0,8) -> (none) (covers)

=== nothing to cut
  no length                    chunk=8 count=3 [0,0) -> (none) (covers)
  no chunk size                chunk=0 count=3 [0,8) -> (none) (covers)
